Status Text: This is the editors' draft of version 1 of the FAIR Data Train Visit Protocol — the protocol between a Data Station and a Train Handler. It is provided for discussion and may change at any moment; its publication does not imply endorsement of its contents by any organization, and it should be cited only as work in progress. The protocol it describes is implemented and exercised end to end by the FAIR Data Train reference implementation; the JSON Schemas, OpenAPI documents and fixtures named in <a href="#artefacts">Appendix B</a> are its normative artefacts, and where this text and those artefacts disagree, the artefacts are what an implementation is held to and this text has an error to be reported.
